oiler":false,"text":"公安妖魔駆除課に所属しており、次期エース候補と呼ばれているルーキー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何故か道の相棒として選ばれ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"道と一緒に一つ屋根の下で暮らすことになってしまったがそれなりに楽しくやっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまに尖ったことを口にすることもあるが、思いやりが強く、負けず嫌いでとても素直。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"知能は低い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"129262"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec0f5acf56f736c207df134e14d2075473e18a362a8c77e57de99863a20bbe84.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c298a4cc0e74a906d5262375f4df10d2ee5a318c8b6f06993d1472f7e39a5d0d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_129263","characterName":"まがつやのみこと","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"129263","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"408944"}]},"originalCharacterName":"まがつやのみこと","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"通称　ヤミ　と呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"突如、黄泉の扉から出現した謎の存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"敵なのか味方なのか、人間なのか妖魔なのかさえもわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある人は彼女をこう称する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eそのものである、と。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"129263"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e81badd7d0f1a857c0077c1d3bacb662316fed6ea1bcce0018121e542850e718.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96e8d081f4afb574debe960819318a639c71c9f8d664aa5f4fc0a468aa3d7b9d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_129264","characterName":"不来方 道","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"129264","match"